From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 15:45:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DVDDemuxClient: give its streams the demuxer's id

The streams of an add-on demuxer kept demuxer id -1, while its packets
carry the demuxer's own id. The player tells a stale stream from a
current one by demuxer id and stream id. A stream of a closed add-on
demuxer matched the stream with the same id in the next one.
---
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDDemuxers/DVDDemuxClient.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDDemuxers/DVDDemuxClient.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDDemuxers/DVDDemuxClient.cpp
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDDemuxers/DVDDemuxClient.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDDemuxers/DVDDemuxClient.cpp
@@ -0,6 +0,7 @@
     std::dynamic_pointer_cast<CDemuxStreamClientInternal>(toStream)->m_announced = *stream;
 
   toStream->uniqueId = stream->uniqueId;
+  toStream->demuxerId = GetDemuxerId();
   toStream->codec = stream->codec;
   toStream->codecName = stream->codecName;
   toStream->codec_fourcc = stream->codec_fourcc;
